  fb("Hurry up! We can't ___ the train.", ["miss", "arrive", "cross"], "Miss the train — запізнитися на поїзд. Hurry up — поспішіть."),
  mc("Хтось сидить на вашому місці. Що сказати?", ["Excuse me, I think this is my seat.", "Excuse me, you are my seat.", "Sorry, this seat is me."], "Excuse me, I think this is my seat."),
